  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Ce qui / ce que / ce dont",
   "texto": [
    "**Ce qui** (what makes it a subject): **Ce qui est important, c'est la santé** (what matters is health).",
    "**Ce que** (what you do as an object): **Ce que tu dis est vrai** (what you say is true).",
    "**Ce dont** means «which» when the phrase needs **de**: **Ce dont j'ai besoin, c'est de repos** (what I need is rest)."
   ]
